      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a little clunky, in that it gets updated every time this state runs, as opposed to only once when we receive the PS_RDY. It\u0027s possible that this start point is minutely too early. Conversely, the real start point should be when we receive the interrupt from the TCPC that a message has come in, which we later decode to a PS_RDY. So this start point may actually be too late.",
